DATA LICENSES (SEPARATE FROM SOFTWARE):
- Real-application traces (`real_app_pageref`, captured via `tracer/pc_trace.c`)
  and instrumented-program kernel traces (`instrumented_program`) are original
  work released under CC-BY-4.0.
- Public FIU block-I/O traces (`fiu_public`) originate from the Florida
  International University I/O trace dataset (Koller & Rangaswami, ACM TOS 2010)
  via the CMU PDL cacheDatasets mirror and remain subject to their respective
  upstream non-commercial / academic terms.
- Public PDL storage/cache traces (`pdl_public`: Alibaba, CloudPhysics, MetaKV,
  MSR, Tencent, Twitter) remain subject to the CMU Parallel Data Laboratory
  (PDL) copyright notice and upstream dataset licenses:
  https://pdl.cmu.edu/Publications/copyright.shtml
